diff --git a/docs/architecture/module-boundaries.md b/docs/architecture/module-boundaries.md
@@ Ozon category-query boundary
+`ozon-category-service.mjs` owns Ozon query, response validation, six-hour TTL cache,
+pagination and type resolution; it neither reads local product caches nor maps HTTP.
+`ozon-category-routes.mjs` owns authentication, account/store validation, parameter parsing
+and HTTP mapping for the three existing paths; it neither reads local product caches nor
+implements category algorithms.
+Local product caches are forbidden as a category source. Preview and listing consume the
+stable service methods `getCategoryTree`, `getCategoryAttributes` and
+`getCategoryAttributeValues`; required-data failure propagates and cannot create a
+successful preview or listing task. Existing HTTP success fields remain compatible.
+The migration guard is documented as 5200 and may only be lowered later.

